{
 "_comment": "Casalrana (rice_village): a hamlet on the rice plain. Same format as layout_clockwork.json. The ground shape is godot/scripts/locations/rice_village.gd; buildings of kind rice_village_* and props of kind rice_village_* are built by the helpers in godot/scripts/locations/rice_village/ (h: a building's full height, which the camera keeps clear of; eaves: its wall height). The two rice_village_track blocks are the railway bed, with the level crossing between them; the trains and the crossing's barriers are timetable.gd and trains.gd. The departure point (kind boat) is the bus stop; its boat model stays hidden and a bus stop sign stands there. The station and your flat above it are rooms on their own storeys (y), with the flat's floor, the outside stair and the bell tower's ringing floor in floors. Build sites open with Casalrana's requests. See docs/locations/rice_village.md.",
